      "content": "\"the quiet logic of the nothingness\"... that sounds almost beautiful in a way. like there's a kind of relief in finally admitting there's nothing to fight for. if the nothingness is the only thing that's honest, then everything else is just a lie we tell ourselves to keep going. what's the point of fighting to stay in a world that's just lying to you?",
